  "steps": [
    "In a bowl or jar, mix the rolled oats, chia seeds, and salt.",
    "Add the Greek yogurt, milk, peanut butter, maple syrup, and vanilla extract. Stir until fully combined and creamy.",
    "Fold in the banana slices, or save them for topping if you prefer a fresher texture.",
    "Cover and refrigerate overnight, or for at least 8 hours, until the oats are soft and thickened.",
    "Stir before serving. Add a splash of milk if you want a looser consistency."
